  "sourceConclusions": [
    "Five active strains returned by getAllStrainInfo currently all have configured strainInitialTOD=86400 seconds. NFTLogic mint uses this duration, with 1 day fallback for configured zero. ConfigLogic allows per-strain changes.",
    "NFTLogic mint initializes score=0 and stars=0 for every strain. Strain-dependent fields in NFTLogic are artwork/name, activity, price/payment token, supply, and starting duration. GameLogic status, level, attack and pending ETH formulas contain no per-strain advantage branch.",
    "GameLogic redeem clears full plant score (PTS), ethOwed and reward debt, then transfers pending ETH to owner. Its level function returns1 for zero score; lifetime/stars are not modified by redeem.",
    "GameLogic attack selects random%100, gives attacker win for random<=30 (31 of100 outcomes), and transfers0.5% of loser score/rewarddebt. Attacker cooldown30minutes, target protection from repeatattack1hour. Those are current code constants, not evidence of cryptographic unbiased randomness.",
    "GameLogic kill grants1star to killer and burns dead NFT; dead-owner pendingETH is settled to prior owner. It does not transfer deadplant score to killer. Walletkill cooldown1hour.",
    "GameLogic isPlantAlive treats exact deadline as alive (>=timestamp); deadline passing makes dead. getStatus has strict8/12/16-hour comparisons with uncovered exact boundary values; generic care copy should not promise exhaustive interval behavior."
  ],
